# Documented HIGH severity exceptions for `trivy image --severity HIGH,CRITICAL --exit-code 1`.
# Full CVE-by-CVE justification, applicability reasoning, and accepter is
# recorded in docs/adr/0019-container-image-hardening-and-scan-gate.md.
# All five findings below have no published fix in gcr.io/distroless/python3-debian13
# as of the accepted-at date and are in code paths this service does not exercise.
# Accepted by: Amos Maddux (amosmaddux@gmail.com) — 2026-08-05

# ncurses buffer overflow (libncursesw6, libtinfo6) — service is headless, no curses usage.
CVE-2025-69720

# tarfile.extractall() data/tar filter bypass (libpython3.13-*, python3.13-*) — app never imports tarfile.
CVE-2026-11940

# stdlib html.parser CPU DoS (libpython3.13-*, python3.13-*) — app never imports html.parser, JSON only.
CVE-2026-15308

# expat XML parser DoS (libpython3.13-*, python3.13-*) — app never imports xml/expat, accepts no XML input.
CVE-2026-7210

# libblkid integer overflow via libuuid1 — app only uses pure-Python uuid.UUID() string parsing.
CVE-2026-53615
